    "dull heart pain.",
    "He was everything",
    "to me; father,",
    "companion, friend.",
    "~~advi[?]~~ I do not",
    "know whether",
    "I most valued",
    "his advice or his",
    "sympathy. He",
    "was so fond of",
    "all amusements",
    "and outdoor sports,",
    "as riding, sailing",
    "and shooting; and,",
    "without a particle",
    "of cant, was so",
    "deeply religious."
